sequenceDiagram
  participant U as You
  participant S as Settings form
  participant M as Main process
  participant G as Gmail (SMTP)
  participant D as Stores
  Note over U,D: Adding the account
  U->>S: name, Gmail, address, app password
  S->>M: email-connections:validate
  M->>G: login only, no message sent
  G-->>M: ok, or an error
  M-->>S: ok, or the error text
  S->>M: email-connections:save (only if ok)
  M->>D: metadata to emailConnections setting, password to email:id
  Note over U,D: Sending a message
  U->>M: "email the report to ..."
  M->>M: Email role calls send_email
  M->>U: confirmation: account, recipients, subject, attachments
  U->>M: approve
  M->>D: read the password for email:id
  M->>G: send (attachments read from the workspace)
